[Lemma lem : FdTmon/LowerBoundWeak of arXiv:2412.03320, 'Large deviation principle at speed $n$ for the random metric in first-passage percolation'] For all finite families of injective, pairwise disjoint, $1$-Lipschitz paths $\p{\gamma_k : \intervalleff{0}{T_k} \rightarrow X }_{1\le k \le K}$,
	\begin{equation}

		\FdTmoninf(D) \ge \sum_{k=1}^K J_{\mathrm{pp}} \mathopen{}\mathclose\bgroup\originalleft( \gamma_k(T_k) - \gamma_k(0), D(\gamma_k) \aftergroup\egroup\originalright).
	\end{equation}

