Then for every $\xi \in D(A^2)$ there exists a unique mild solution $$(Y,Y') \in \scrd_X^{2 \beta}([0,T],W)$$ to the random RPDE \eqref{RPDE-fractional} with $Y_0 = \xi$ on $N^c$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

