\noindent{\bf step 1} Linear conjugation. We solve the linear problem
\begin{equation}

\left[x+xH^\infty_{20}\right](-x)\tilde{\Psi}'+ \left[-2x(1+H^\infty_{20})-a_\infty(1+G^\infty_1)+2xG^\infty_2\right]\tilde{\Psi} =xF.
