with an integer $n >d/4$ and $\lambda=0 $. Let $f\in C^{\infty}_{0}$. Then 
\begin{equation}

 \sum_{n=1}^{\infty}\int_{\Gamma_{n}(t_{0})}T_{0,t_{n }}
