N\Big(\int_{\bR^{d}}|Df|^{4n}\,dx\Big)^{1/(2n)},
\end{equation}
where $N$ depends only on $d,\delta,p_{0},\rho_{0},n,t_{0}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

