\medskip
\noindent\textit{Verification of (equation eq:RBJ-psi-S1 of the paper).}
From the contour representation,
\[
\psi_{t,r,n}(x) = \frac{\alpha^{-n+1}}{2\pi\mathrm{i}}
  \oint_{\gamma_\rho} \frac{\mathrm{d} w}{w}
  \frac{\theta^{r-x}}{w^{r-x+n}}
  (1{-}w)^n (q{+}pw)^t.
\]
The shift $r \to r+1$ contributes a factor $\theta/w$ to
the integrand of $\psi_{t,r+1,n}$ relative to
$\psi_{t,r,n}$.  Factoring out the common integrand, the
right-hand side of (equation eq:RBJ-psi-S1 of the paper) becomes
\begin{align*}
&(1{-}\theta)^{-1}\psi_{t,r+1,n}(x)
