[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2606.11068, '2606.11068'] The following hitting-time asymptotics hold:
\[
  \frac{\tau_n^*}{n}
  \xrightarrow[n\to\infty]{a.s.}
  \frac1v.
\]
Moreover, if \(r>1/2\), then
\[
  \frac{\tau_n^+}{n}
  \xrightarrow[n\to\infty]{a.s.}
  \frac1{2r-1},
\]
whereas, if \(r<1/2\), then
\[
  \frac{\tau_n^-}{n}
  \xrightarrow[n\to\infty]{a.s.}
  \frac1{1-2r}.
\]

