[Prop non-zero plaquette assignments three of arXiv:2508.13827, 'Surface sums in two-dimensional large-$N$ lattice Yang--Mills: Cancellations and explicit '] Let $\ell$ be any non-trivial loop and $\mathcal{K}_{\ell}^3$ the set of plaquette assignments such that for all $p\in \mathcal{P}^+$,
    \begin{align*}
        K(p) +K(p^{-1})\leq d_{\ell}(p).
    \end{align*}
    If $K\notin \mathcal{K}_{\ell}^3$, then $\phi^K(\ell)=0$.

