[Lemma lem_survival_prob of arXiv:2605.27949, 'Yaglom limits of continuous-state branching processes in Brownian random environment \than'] In the weakly subcritical regime $({\bf m}\in(-\sigma^2,0))$, the survival probability of the process satisfies the asymptotic relationship:
\begin{eqnarray*}
\lim _{t \rightarrow \infty}t^{3/2} \mathrm{e}^{\frac{{\bf m}^2}{2 \sigma^2} t}\mathbb{P}^z\left(Z_t>0\right) = \frac{4\sqrt 2}{\sigma^3\beta^3\sqrt{ \pi }} \Psi(z).
\end{eqnarray*}

