[Definition def:question of arXiv:2504.19367, 'Reduced Random Walks in the Hyperbolic Plane\textinterrobang'] {MR7929}}]
    \textcolor{blue}{\emph{Minkowski's question-mark function}} $\? : [0, 1] \cap \mathbb{Q} \to \mathbb{R}$ is given by
\[\?(x) = \begin{cases}
    0 & \mbox{if $x = 0$} \\\noalign{\vskip5pt}
    \displaystyle\frac{1}{2^{\lfloor 1 / x \rfloor}}\left(2 -  \?\left(\left\{\frac{1}{x}\right\}\right)\right) & \mbox{otherwise}
\end{cases}.\]

