[Lemma 51 of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] For every \(u\geq0\), under \(K_u\) the centred deficit path
\begin{equation}
  G^{(u)}(t):=-W_t,\qquad -u\leq t<\infty,

\end{equation}
satisfies
\begin{equation}
  G^{(u)}(0)=0,
  \qquad
  G^{(u)}(t)>0\quad\text{for every }t\neq0
  \quad\text{almost surely}.

\end{equation}

