[Lemma l:B1-B2 of arXiv:2411.12003, 'Central Limit Theorem for non-stationary random products of $\SL(2, \R)$ matrices'] For any $B_1,B_2\in {\mathrm{SL}}(2,{\mathbb R})$ and any nonzero vector $v$,
\begin{equation}
\log \|B_1\| + \log \|B_2\| - \log \|B_2B_1\| \le \Theta(B_1,v) + \Theta(B_2, B_1 v).
\end{equation}

