[Lemma 83 of arXiv:2510.27589, 'Geodesic switches and exceptional times in dynamical Brownian last passage percolation'] For all $m,\ell,n,\delta$ as before, we have the inclusion
\begin{equation}

  \TP_{\ell,m}\cap (\TF_{\ell,m})^c\subseteq (\bigcup_{k=1}^{2f(\ell)}\TP_{\ell,m}^k) \cup \bigcup_{m=1}^{2f(\ell)} \{|\max_{y\in J_k}Z_{\0}^{\n,\bullet}(m+m^{2/3}y,m)-\max_{y\in J_k^c}Z_{\0}^{\n,\bullet}(m+m^{2/3}y,m)|\leq \ell^\delta\}.
\end{equation}

