[Lemma lemmaboundthetak of arXiv:2608.30443, 'On smooth holosphere solutions to compressible Euler equation'] There exists $c_{\nu,a}>0$ and $b^*(\nu,a)$ such that for all $0<b<b^*$, for all $0\le k\le K-1$,
\begin{equation}

|\theta_k|\leq c_{\nu,a}|w_{\gamma-1,\nu_b+1}(k)|
\end{equation}
