[Proposition 37 ({\cite[Chapter 6.1) of arXiv:2606.12670, 'The censored stochastic six-vertex model and parabolic Kazhdan--Lusztig $R$-polynomials'] {MR2133266}}]  Recall the definition of $\widetilde{T}_{\sigma} = q^{\ell(\sigma)}T_{\sigma}$ from Remark \ref{rmk:tildeT}. Then we have 
