[Lem Qtail of arXiv:2504.19942, 'The edge-averaging process on graphs \\ with random initial opinions'] For all $t>0$, we have  
\begin{equation}
    \mathbb P (Q_t\ge 6t_*^{-1/2}) \le  \exp (-t_*/30) \,,   
\end{equation}
where $t_*=\min(t,|V|^2)$. 
Consequently, $\mathbb{E}[Q_t]\leq 8t_{*}^{-1/2}$.

