d_{\rm TV}\left((M_{n,i})_{i=1}^K\,,\,(\lceil\xi_i+ (e-1)\tau+\tb_n\rceil)_{i=1}^K\right)\to 0,
\end{equation}
where $\tau\stackrel{\rm d}{=}{\rm Gumbel}(\ell+1)$ is independent of\/
$\Xi=\{\xi_i\}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

