[Lemma 3 of arXiv:2605.03236, 'Stochastic It\^o Equations and Parabolic Second-Order Equations with singular Drift'] In the notation of Lemma \ref{lemma 4.23.3}
for any Borel $f( x)\geq0$ we have
\begin{equation}

E_{\cF_{\tau}}\int_{\tau}^{\gamma}e^{-\phi_{\tau,t}} (\det a_{t}) ^{1/d}
f( x_{t})\,dA_{t}\leq N(d)
 (B^{2}+A)^{1/2}\|f\|_{L_{d }(\bR^{d })}.
