body:
[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2609.02225, '\textbf{The direct moving plane method for weak solutions of the fractional $p$-Laplacian}'] Let \(n\ge2\), \(0<s<1\) and \(1<p\le2\). Let $0\le u\in \mathcal D^{s,p}(\mathbb R^n)\cap C(\mathbb R^n)$ be a weak solution of \eqref{eq:whole-space-critical-equation}. Then
\begin{equation}
        \lim_{R\to\infty}
        \sup_{|x|\ge R}|x|^{\beta_c}u(x)=0,\qquad \text{where } \beta_c:=\frac{n-sp}{p}.
\end{equation}

