[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2606.21394, 'McKean-Vlasov Equations for Large Networks of Neurons with Adaptive Asymmetric Edges'] Suppose that with unit probability,
\begin{align} 
\lim_{n\to \infty}d_{L^2}\big( \hat{\mu}^n  , \mu \big) = 0.
\end{align}
Then with unit probability,
\begin{align}
    \lim_{n\to \infty}d_{W}\big( \hat{\mu}^n  , \mu \big) = 0 .
\end{align} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

