[Theorem of arXiv:2608.10415, 'Continuous random variables'] The negative binomial law $c_{mp}$ has the following properties:
\begin{enumerate}
\item The mean is $E=\frac{m(1-p)}{p}$.

\item The variance is $V=\frac{m(1-p)}{p^2}$.
\end{enumerate}

