[Prop positivity of tau of arXiv:2608.18045, 'Supercritical sharpness for the random cluster representation of real-valued spin models'] For every $\beta \geq \beta_c$,
\begin{equation}
\boldsymbol{\tau}(\beta) \geq 2^d\int_{\beta_c}^\beta \big(\langle \tau_0 \rangle_u^+\big)^2 \mathrm{d}u.  
\end{equation}
In particular, for $\beta>\beta_c$, one has $\boldsymbol{\tau}(\beta)>0$.

