for any $n \geqslant 1$ and $x \in \bb R$, 
\begin{align*}
\bb P \left(\tau_x >n \right) \leqslant c  \frac{1+V(x)  L\left(\frac{x}{\sigma\sqrt{n}}\right) }{n^{1/2}}. 
\end{align*}

