[Prop cmj-speed of arXiv:2609.00110, 'Phase Transition and Fluctuation Results for First-Passage Percolation on Spread-Out Cycle'] For the continuous CMJ branching random walk,
\begin{align}
\frac{\mathsf{M}_t}{t}\to \mathsf{v}^\star
\text{ a.s.}

\end{align}
Consequently,
\begin{align}
\frac{\tau(f)}{f}\to \frac1{\mathsf{v}^\star}
\text{ a.s. and in }L^1,
\text{ and }
\E\tau(f)=\frac{f}{\mathsf{v}^\star}+o(f).

\end{align}

