[Proposition 1 of arXiv:2608.28991, 'Jigsaw-CRL: Recovering Global Latent Causal Order from Fragmented Multi-Client Interventio'] For $Z$ generated by Eq.~\eqref{eq:gloabl latent}, let $Z_k=(Z_{(i)})_{i\in O_k}$. Then
\begin{equation}
Z_k = \bA_k Z_k + E_k,
\end{equation}
where
\begin{align}

    \bA_k
    &=
    [\bA]_{O_k,O_k}
    +
    [\bA]_{O_k,M_k}
    (\bI-[\bA]_{M_k,M_k})^{-1}
    [\bA]_{M_k,O_k}, \\
    E_k
    &=
    E_{O_k}
    +
    [\bA]_{O_k,M_k}
    (\bI-[\bA]_{M_k,M_k})^{-1}
    E_{M_k}.
\end{align}
Moreover, $E_k$ has mean zero and covariance
\begin{equation}

    \bSigma_k
    =
    [\bSigma]_{O_k,O_k}
    +
    [\bA]_{O_k,M_k}
    (\bI-[\bA]_{M_k,M_k})^{-1}
    [\bSigma]_{M_k,M_k}
    (\bI-[\bA]_{M_k,M_k})^{-T}
    [\bA]_{O_k,M_k}^{T}.
\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

