[Lemma lemma_Xk_recursion of arXiv:2603.29442, 'A compact support property for infinite-dimensional SDEs with Hölder continuous coefficien'] For sufficiently small $\zeta>0$, for all $\delta \in (0,1]$, $\mathbb{P} \in \mathscr{M}_{\gamma,\delta}(x)$, $k \in \mathbb{N}_0$ and $R > r \geq 0$,
\begin{equation}
\mathbb{P}(X_k > R) \leq \mathbb{P}_{a_k}'( \tau_{a_{k-1}} \wedge \tau_{a_{k-1}} > r) + \frac 3 4 \cdot \mathbb{P}_{a_k}''(X_k > R-r)
\end{equation}
for some $\mathbb{P}_{a_k}', \mathbb{P}_{a_k}'' \in \mathscr{M}_{\gamma,\delta}(a_k)$.

