[Lemma 3.9 of arXiv:2606.27844, 'Critical percolation on preferential attachment graphs with infinite variance'] If $\varphi_n=\beta(n)n^{\gamma -1/2} \to \varphi >0$, then 
for every fixed $i\in\mathbb N$,  
\begin{align}
    \frac{\# C(i)}{n^\gamma \beta(n)}\overset{d}{\longrightarrow} \sum_{j\in\mathcal C(i)} \frac{1}{\gamma}\, j^{-\gamma} \;.
\end{align}

