    \mathbb{P}_{\rho_0} \big( \mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{cluster}}^c \big)
    \le C_{\textnormal{\tiny (C:big_cluster of the paper)}} \ell_0^{2 + (m - 1)\beta - ms}.
  \end{equation}

[Proposition prop:fik-lacks-negdia-to-boxneg of arXiv:2608.29708, 'Intuitionistic and Constructive Modal Logics for Classical Modal Logicians'] $\textbf{FIK} \nvdash \neg \Diamond \varphi \to \Box \neg \varphi$.
  \begin{proof}
    One can construct a falsifying model that satisfies the $\Diamond$-p and $\Box$-p conditions but not FS2.
    The model is visualized in Figure (fig:negdia-countermodel of the paper).
    One can show that $x \Vdash^{\text{h}} \neg \Diamond p$ but $x \not \Vdash^{\text{h}} \Box \neg p$,
