[Lemma 40 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] For $2a_n+1> 2/\beta$ and $0< \eps\le 1$, we have 
    \begin{align}
          \ev[\|\mathsf{k}_{\beta,2a_n}\ind(\max(x,y)>1-\eps) \|_2^2]\le \frac{2\eps}{2a_n+1-2/\beta}. 
    \end{align}

