[Lemma lem.follmervalue of arXiv:2605.14149, 'The mean-field limit of online stochastic vector balancing'] Fix $p\geq 2$. The function $\mathcal{U}_p^\mathrm{F}$ is upper semicontinuous on $[0,1]$. In particular, it is bounded and
    \begin{equation*}
        \lim_{t \to 1} \mathcal{U}_p^\mathrm{F}(t) = 0.
    \end{equation*}

