Then by Fatou's Lemma, $\lim_{k\to\infty}\mathbb E [(M_k)^p]\geq \mathbb E [\lim_{k\to\infty}(M_k)^p]=\mathbb E[J^p]$. Hence, $\mathbb E[J^p]=0$ by noting that $J$ is","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:d14f82909004db5f27f07c2cd1ed91249faa0e3f44e3ace4fa9bf5ea2f22939e","revision_digest":"sha256:9f51ff17acc20f4770eddc9ff7504833e86af88a1b7feb1b408ac6aca0cb5665","source_id":"arxiv:2603.01823","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

