Combining (equation eq:MFEdiffusiveGronwall of the paper) with (equation eq:intro-entropy-rewrite of the paper),
\begin{align}
\mathsf{H}\pa*{f_N^t\vert{\mathbb{Q}}_{N,\beta}(\mu^t)}
\le
