(N_{\mathbf{n}_{T}}(\mathcal{T}_{\mathbf{n}}))^{2} = \sum_{T^{\prime} \in \mathbb{T}_{\mathbf{n}_{T}}} (N_{T^{\prime}}(\mathcal{T}_{\mathbf{n}}))^{2} + \sum_{T^{\prime} \in \mathbb{T}_{\mathbf{n}_{T}}} ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:d14f82909004db5f27f07c2cd1ed91249faa0e3f44e3ace4fa9bf5ea2f22939e","revision_digest":"sha256:a40a2d6502915264a09e24562df3d61d898dbe5219a5e2c4144d37e7a5d3f87f","source_id":"arxiv:2604.06012","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

