[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2607.27082, '2607.27082'] There exists $C<\infty$ such that
\begin{equation}
\PP(\tau_1^+(Y_n)\le t)\le Ct,
\qquad n\ge1,\quad 0<t\le1.
\end{equation}
Equivalently,
\begin{equation}
\PP(\tau_n^+\le tn^r)\le Ct,
\qquad n\ge1,\quad 0<t\le1.
\end{equation}

