[Proposition 13 of arXiv:2608.03771, '\vspace{-5ex}\bfseries\scshape{Local law and delocalization for the Sachdev--Ye--Kitaev mo'] We have
\begin{equation}

\E\left[\left\lVert \exp\big(-\i t H_q\big)-V_N(t) \right\rVert_2^2\right]\lesssim \alpha_{N,q}t^4+\alpha_{N,q}^2t^6.
