$ defined in (equation e:R-nF of the paper):
\begin{equ}
\sum_{k} \frac{1}{| k |^{2 \alpha} } \| R[\sigma_{k}] \psi \|_{H^{-
(\alpha +1)}}^{2} \simeq \| \psi \|_{H^{- (\alpha +1)}}^{2} \;.
\end{equ}

