[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2511.09726, 'The non-covered set in Dvoretzky covering is a set of multiplicity'] Let $K_n(t)\coloneqq \exp{(\sum_{k=1}^n(\ell_k-|t|)_+)}$ for any $t\in\mathbb{T}$. Then
there is $C> 0$ such that for any $t,t^\prime \in \mathbb T$ and any $n\geq1$, one has

    \begin{equation}
        \frac{1}{C}K_n(t-t^\prime)\leq\mathbb E[M_n(t)M_n(t^\prime)] \leq CK_n(t-t^\prime).

    \end{equation}

