[Lemma 27 (Gaussian transportation) of arXiv:2608.25706, 'Fast rates in Bayesian online learning with approximate posteriors'] \label[lemma]{lem:gp-transport}
Let $\gamma$  be a Gaussian law on $L^2(\bP_X)$ with covariance operator $\Sigma$. If $\nu\ll\gamma$ and $\KL(\nu\|\gamma)<\infty$, then
    \begin{equation}
    \W^2(\nu,\gamma) \le 2\opnorm{\Sigma}\KL(\nu\|\gamma).
    \end{equation}

