[Lemma lem:oneBodyReduction of arXiv:2609.02743, 'Sharp mean-field estimates for diffusive log/Riesz gases in the Hilbert--Schmidt regime'] Assume the hypotheses of (prop:rieszLaplaceLogFallback of the paper), and recall $\psi_\mu\coloneqq h_\mu-2I_\mu$ and $R_N\coloneqq\frac1N\sum_{i=1}^N\psi_\mu(\xi_i)$ from (equation eq:roadmapIdentity of the paper).  Then, for all $N\ge1$,
\begin{multline}
\Big|{\mathsf{K}}_{N,\beta}(\mu)
-e^{\beta I_\mu}{\mathbb{E}}_{\mu^{\otimes N}}\Big[e^{-\frac{\beta}{2}W_N}\Big]\Big|\\
\le
\beta\,\|\psi_\mu\|_{L^2(\mu)}
\pa[\Big]{C_{\mathrm{ub}}(2\beta,\mu)^{1/2}
+C_{\mathrm{ub}}(4\beta,\mu)^{1/4}\,{\mathbb{E}}_\mu\brak[\big]{e^{-4\beta\psi_\mu}}^{1/4}}\,N^{-1/2}.
\end{multline}

