[Theorem 2tm of arXiv:2411.16647, 'The stochastic evolution of an infinite population with logistic-type interaction'] Let $L$ and $\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}$ be as (equation L of the paper) and Proposition (G1pn of the paper), respectively. Then
 \begin{itemize}
