  \item[(b)] the stochastic process related to the family
  \[
   \{\mathfrak{D}_{[s,+\infty)}(\Gamma_*), \mathfrak{F}_{s,+\infty}, \{\mathfrak{F}_{s,t}:t\geq s\}, \{P_{s,\mu}: s\geq 0, \mu\in \mathcal{P}_{\rm exp}\}: s\geq 0 \}
  \]
is Markov.
\end{itemize} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

